                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I just finished Shenmue 1. I am on a quest to play games where people say they were really good. One day while waiting for my fiance in the car to finish work, I started playing it on the steam deck. Quickly I got lost in Dobuita playing arcades while waiting for the clock to move and continue the story. This is not a game where you move the world. The world pulls you in when it has to. I only wish the open world games had 25 of development of this game style. Maybe things would have been different. If only the dreamcast had survived. I will start Shenmue 2 tonight.",
